  {
   "id": "te110",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 2044,
   "width": 1088.64,
   "height": 202.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "hachure",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1756216314,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1310920283,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760486400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Flows (HLD §5)\n1 Hear: mic → echo cancel → voice detection → transcript → core\n2 Think: core → talker request (on the early final when the talker is hosted, D-262) → LLM streams narration\n3 Speak + draw: clauses → TTS → playback clock → ops fire at their words\n4 Interrupt: duck ≤ 100 ms → classify → stop, freeze, commit what was heard → detour → resume\n5 Ground + delegate: native reads in ms · confined harness briefs, citations checked · confirmed changes\n6 Remember: log → digest → vault → index\n7 Read a document: PDFKit text → reading order → figures (a file-reading model or the harness) → digest\n8 Stage + drill down: lay a map out whole → reveal it part by part → detail layers",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "re109",
   "originalText": "Flows (HLD §5)\n1 Hear: mic → echo cancel → voice detection → transcript → core\n2 Think: core → talker request (on the early final when the talker is hosted, D-262) → LLM streams narration\n3 Speak + draw: clauses → TTS → playback clock → ops fire at their words\n4 Interrupt: duck ≤ 100 ms → classify → stop, freeze, commit what was heard → detour → resume\n5 Ground + delegate: native reads in ms · confined harness briefs, citations checked · confirmed changes\n6 Remember: log → digest → vault → index\n7 Read a document: PDFKit text → reading order → figures (a file-reading model or the harness) → digest\n8 Stage + drill down: lay a map out whole → reveal it part by part → detail layers",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "re111",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1560,
   "y": 1650,
